src/): a hermetic way to reproduce in tests.\nThrowaway worktree removed with `git worktree remove`."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793479929128780001,"uuid":"bbadce9f-9d21-4a4f-8367-5a49ea3207bc"}